<report>
<line><title>False result probabilities</title></line>
<line></line>
<line>For an overall case rate of <in>population</in> per ten thousand population tested:</line>
<line></line>
<line>Test SENSITIVITY = <inu>sensitive</inu>%</line>
<line>Probability of a FALSE POSITIVE result = <pval><inu>positive</inu></pval></line>
<line></line>
<line>Test SPECIFICITY = <inu>specific</inu>%</line>
<line>Probability of a FALSE NEGATIVE result = <pval><inu>negative</inu></pval></line>
</report>
